DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260914T150000
UID:6a4d8f9146bb88360031561c@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us on the 1st Monday afternoon of every month to discus
 s books in a friendly and social atmosphere.\nAugust Book Club\nTitle –\
 nThe Heaven & Earth Grocery Store\nby\nJames McBride\nSeptember Book Club
  Title\n–\nThe Unlikely Pilgrimage of Harold Fry\nby Rachel Joyce\nTo g
 et a copy of the book\, please visit the 1st floor desk at Albert Campbell
  Library. New members are always welcome.\nDrop-in or register for a remin
