UID:6a15a5cefab4ff0f649b9144@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Soak up summer creativity while painting a wooden bookmark ins
 pired by sunshine and warmth. This relaxing program encourages calm\, self
 -expression\, and mindfulness through color and design. No experience need
 ed—just unwind\, paint\, and enjoy a peaceful\, joyful creative break to
 gether today.\nThis is a Drop-In program for Adults and Seniors.\nNo regis
 tration required.\nSpace is limited. All materials are provided.
