UID:6a2055e290cc4e3a790b32a3@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Would you like to improve your English speaking skills in a re
 laxing and supportive environment?  We offer conversation prompts to get y
 ou talking about topics you enjoy. This is a great way to improve your Eng
 lish speaking skills and make new friends.  Learners at all levels are wel
 come. Please note this is\nnot\na formal English class - assessment and ev
 aluation are\nnot\nprovided.
LOCATION:St. Lawrence
