BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Knit and Unwind
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260911T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260911T190000
UID:696282e791e4576f847bd094@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Bring your knitting\, crocheting\, or other needlework project
 s and join fellow makers for a relaxed evening of stitching and conversati
 on. Whether you?re a seasoned knitter or just starting out\, this is a wel
 coming space to share tips\, trade stories\, and enjoy the company of othe
 rs who love working with yarn. Supplies will be provided for beginners who
  are looking to get started on the hobby.\nTime: Second Friday of each mon
 th 5-7pm
LOCATION:Sanderson\, Main Floor Program Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/696282e791e4576f847bd094
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Adults
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Housing Help
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260811T123000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260811T163000
UID:69583000c719ac98c335c8cb@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Drop in and work one-on-one with staff from The Housing Help C
 entre (THHC) to determine your housing needs\, connect you to other govern
 ment services\, and to match you with landlords across the city. THHC work
 s with both individuals and families in the City of Toronto to find and ma
 intain affordable\, safe housing.\nTHHC can be contacted at 416-285-8070.
LOCATION:Malvern
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69583000c719ac98c335c8cb
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Adults
