BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Grown-ups Reading Children's Literature Book Club: The Bad Beginni
 ng (A Series of Unfortunate Events # 1)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261003T143000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261003T160000
UID:6a31913643b41b3d006edb88@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us for the monthly meeting of Osborne Collection Grown-up
 s Reading Children's Literature Book Club. It is  for adult readers who en
 joy children's books. Revisit favourite stories of your childhood or read 
 more or less known notable books for young readers for the first time.\nWe
  meet once a month on the first or second Saturday (2.30-4PM).\nOctober 3:
  A Series of Unfortunate Events: The Bad Beginning by Lemony Snicket\nNove
 mber 14: Borrowers by Mary Norton\nDecember 5: The BFG by Roald Dahl\nJanu
 ary 9 (2027): Number the Stars by Lois Lowry\nThe Bad Beginning
LOCATION:Lillian H. Smith\, Osborne Collection\, 4th floor
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a31913643b41b3d006edb88
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Adults
END:VEVENT
