UID:6a1dddb7bd892a0672e6f513@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Ori Dagan is an award-winning singer-songwriter. He brings a w
 ry and agile sense of swing to everything he does\, whether interpreting a
  standard\, spinning a pop tune on its head or introducing his own origina
 l music and lyrics. His rich bass-baritone voice is unmistakable. Ori will
  be accompanied by Jordan O'Conner on bass.\nFor more information\, contac
 t the Arts Department at 416-393-7157.\nMonday\, July 27\, 2026  7\n:00 
 – 8:00 p.m.\nToronto Reference Beeton Hall
