 paces through poetry. Featuring readings by Jeevan Bhagwat\, League of Can
 adian Poets\, and members of the Scarborough Poetry Club. Facilitated by A
 nna Nieminen\, Poetry Curator.\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe person
 al information on this form is collected by the Toronto Public Library und
 er the Public Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The info
