SUMMARY:Fact or Fiction: Identifying and Combatting Misinformation and Di
 sinformation
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260830T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260830T153000
UID:69dd0e3e129f127438383bb2@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Are you ready to separate fact from fiction in a world filled 
 with misinformation and disinformation? Join us for an interactive and ent
 ertaining program where we'll dive into the fascinating world of misinform
 ation\, exploring its origins\, impact\, and how to combat it effectively.
 \nThis program is perfect for curious minds of all ages who want to arm th
 emselves with the skills needed to navigate the complex landscape of onlin
 e information responsibly and safely.
LOCATION:North York Central Library\, Room 101
