BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Your Health Matters: Healthy Habits for Everyday Life
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260723T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260723T190000
UID:6a5022e51006a63d0021544f@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an engaging health promotion webinar focused on st
 aying healthy while enjoying the excitement of FIFA. Whether you’re chee
 ring on your favourite team\, hosting watch parties\, or staying up for la
 te-night matches\, it’s important to prioritize your health and well-bei
 ng along the way.\nThis session will explore:\nTips for managing chronic c
 onditions during busy events and irregular routines\nHealthy habits you ca
 n incorporate while enjoying game days\nThe importance of preventative car
 e and staying connected to healthcare supports\nWhy having a family doctor
  matters and how they can support your long-term health\nOur speakers will
  also share local resources and practical strategies to help you stay conn
 ected to care while balancing everyday life and the excitement of the tour
 nament.\nCome learn\, ask questions\, and celebrate the connection between
  community\, wellness\, and the world’s game.\nThis program is presented
  by Toronto Public Library in collaboration with the\nWest Toronto Ontario
  Health Team\n(OHT)\, a network of over 40 local health and social service
  providers working together to improve the health and well-being of commun
 ities in West Toronto. This session is being delivered by health professio
 nals from\nLAMP Community Health Centre\n\, a member organization of the W
 est Toronto Ontario Health Team.\nYour Health Matters\nThis program is par
 t of Toronto Public Library’s\nYour Health Matters\ninitiative\, which o
 ffers trusted health programs and resources to help people make informed d
 ecisions about their health. Learn more by exploring the\nYour Health Matt
 ers web page\n.\nReserve Your Spot Today!\nThis virtual event is free to j
 oin but registration is required.\nPlease register on Eventbrite\n.\nOnce 
 registered\, you’ll receive an email with details on how to join the ses
 sion.\nWe can’t wait to see you there!
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a5022e51006a63d0021544f
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Adults
END:VEVENT
