DESCRIPTION:Join our Fall 2026 Business Inc. Information Session\nto learn
  about this 8-week program supporting\nnew and early-stage entrepreneurs\
 nin Toronto to launch and grow.\nDo you have a small business or idea and
  want tailored feedback and support to take it to the next level? Join the
  Business Inc. Program to connect with experienced mentors and other entre
 preneurs that will help you grow.\nDuring eight weekly sessions\, entrepre
 neurs will learn business fundamentals\, get clarity on the viability of t
 heir business ideas\, get feedback and reviews from professional business 
 advisors\, discuss with and learn from their peers\, and build a foundatio
 n for success.\nJoin us at the\nfree\nInformation Session to learn more ab
 out this program\, meet the instructor\, and ask any questions you may hav
 e about your application.\nThe program will run weekly at North York Centr
 al Library on\nTuesday evenings from October 20 to December 8\, 2026.\nThe
  cost for the 8-week program is\n$150 + HST per participant (a value of $
 700).\nLearn about\nBusiness Inc.\n\, an eight-week business program offer
 ed in partnership with the Toronto Business Development Centre.\nRegistrat
 ion is required. To register\, click\nhere\n.
