UID:6a529054f4e5db3d00c10f41@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Whether you're an avid reader or a total beginner\, come join 
 us for a monthly discussion circle surrounding either a beloved comic book
  character or celebrated author in the comic world! Participants are welco
 me to select from any comics related to the monthly theme.\nRegistration 
 is optional\, drop-ins welcome.\nMonthly Themes:\nMay 15th:\nBatman\, char
 acter\nJune 19th:\nJames Tynion IV\, author\nJuly 17th\n: Supergirl\, char
 acter\nAugust 21st:\nGrant Morrison\, author\nSeptember 18th:\nSpider-Man\
 , character\nFuture dates to be determined.\nInformation Collection Notice
 :\nThe personal information on this form is collected by the Toronto Publi
 c Library under the Public Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20
 (d). The information will only be used for event and program registration\
 , delivery and evaluation. Questions about how the library handles your in
 formation can be directed to Answerline staff at\nanswerline@tpl.ca\n\, 41
 6-397-5981\, 789 Yonge Street\, Toronto ON M4W 2G8.
LOCATION:Parkdale\, Auditorium A
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a529054f4e5db3d00c10f41
