DESCRIPTION:In partnership with Volunteer Toronto\, j\noin us for a free 
 information session and discover how to safely get involved in formal volu
 nteering. In this session you will learn how to start your formal voluntee
 ring\, understand how to use Volunteer Toronto's website to search for opp
 ortunities that best match your interests and skills\, discuss what to exp
 ect after you apply for a volunteer role. This session is great for anyon
 e who wants to make a positive impact on our city or learn new skills.\nRe
 gistration is encouraged\non TPL’s website.\nDrop-ins welcome until capa
 city is reached.\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe personal information
  on this form is collected by the Toronto Public Library under the Public 
