DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260806T150000
UID:6949a99b6724c63d00e83226@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Create your own vision board with us every month\, to help mo
 tivate you to reach your goals! A vision board is a tool\, made with image
 s or words\, to help people visualize what they want to do or achieve with
 in a limited period of time. All materials such as poster boards\, magazin
 es\, and other supplies for vision board crafting will be provided.\nQuest
 ions\, or interested in registering? Connect with a staff member at our se
 rvice desk or call us.\n***\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe personal 
 information on this form is collected by the Toronto Public Library under 
 the Public Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The informa
 tion will only be used for event and program registration\, delivery and e
 valuation. Questions about how the library handles your information can be
  directed to Answerline staff at\nanswerline@tpl.ca\n\, 416-397-5981\, 789
  Yonge Street\, Toronto ON M4W 2G8.
