BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:NatureTO: Trees Around the Branch Tour
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260722T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260722T153000
UID:699cea85b48451fc3c04b30b@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:The Gerrard/Ashdale neighbourhood is home to a variety of tree
 s. Join the City of Toronto Urban Forestry staff to explore the natural wo
 rld on a\nlocal neighbourhood tour.\nLearn how to recognize different spec
 ies and learn fun facts about their cultural and ecological importance.\nT
 he tour content is intended for adults. Children are welcome but childre
 n under 12 must be accompanied by a parent/caregiver.\nRegistration is re
 quired\n– please register online or contact the branch if you need assis
 tance. When registering\, please include the total number of people who wi
 ll be attending the program\, including both adults and children.\nThe tou
 r will start and end at the Gerrard/Ashdale Branch main entrance and will 
 be guided by the City of Toronto Urban Forestry staff. There may be uneven
 \, unpaved surfaces along the route. Please dress and prepare accordingly 
 for this outdoor program (e.g. gloves/mittens\, hats\, sunscreen\, water\,
  comfortable shoes).\nThis program takes place rain or shine. In the event
  of severe inclement weather\, registrants will be notified of an alternat
 ive date.\nThis program is part of TPL's\nOur Fragile Planet\nprogram seri
 es\, supported by Friends of Toronto Public Library\, South Chapter.​\nI
 nformation Collection Notice:\nThe personal information on this form is co
 llected by the Toronto Public Library under the Public Libraries Act\, sec
 tions 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The information will only be used for eve
 nt and program registration\, delivery and evaluation. Questions about how
  the library handles your information can be directed to Answerline staff 
 at\nanswerline@tpl.ca\n\, 416-397-5981\, 789 Yonge Street\, Toronto ON M4W
  2G8.
LOCATION:Gerrard/Ashdale\, Meet at the branch entrance.
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/699cea85b48451fc3c04b30b
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Adults
END:VEVENT
