SUMMARY:Kimbap Making with Chef Sang RESCHEDULED
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260723T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260723T193000
UID:699e4317cbf1533ca5384f34@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Chef Sang Kim leads a hands-on one-hour workshop on how to mak
 e the iconic Korean seaweed and rice roll\, kimbap. Each participant will 
 be taught how to construct\, season\, roll\, and cut their own kimbap roll
 . They will also be able to consume the large roll upon completion.\n(Fish
 cake or canned tuna options)\nIf you are registered\, please be no more th
 an 5 minutes late or your spot may be offered to someone else.\nInformatio
 n Collection Notice:\nThe personal information on this form is collected b
 y the Toronto Public Library under the Public Libraries Act\, sections 20(
 a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The information will only be used for event and pr
 ogram registration\, delivery and evaluation. Questions about how the libr
 ary handles your information can be directed to Answerline staff at\nanswe
 rline@tpl.ca\n\, 416-397-5981\, 789 Yonge Street\, Toronto ON M4W 2G8.
LOCATION:Palmerston\, Program Room (downstairs)
