DESCRIPTION:Calling all adventurers!\nCome heed the call and learn the bas
 ics of Dungeons & Dragons. Learn the ins and outs of one of the worlds mos
 t popular Tabletop Roleplaying Games.\nNo experience required\, this is an
  absolute beginner friendly event.\nNo need to bring characters or charact
 er sheets. Pre-generated characters will be provided.\nThis program is int
 ended for a mature audience.\nRegistration is required. Please register on
 line or by calling 416-395-5720. Space is limited.
