DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260730T153000
UID:6a32950f8ea300e2631e496e@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:This is for participants who have basic internet skills but wa
 nt to learn more about online safety & privacy. We will cover tips for cre
 ating secure passwords\, using public Wi-Fi safely\, protecting your devic
 e from malware\, recognizing online scams\, & more.\nTHURS JULY 30 @ 2:00-
 3:30PM\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe personal information on this f
 orm is collected by the Toronto Public Library under the Public Libraries 
 Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The information will only be use
 d for event and program registration\, delivery and evaluation. Questions 
