DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260724T120000
UID:6a42705c541102b7fa8928f5@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Overview of child and family benefits\, especially in the low-
 income families\, including (CDCP)\nCanadian Dental Care Plan\, CDB (Canad
 ian Disability Benefits)\, EI (Employment Insurance)\,\nCWB (Canada Worker
 s Benefits)\, and other federal/provincial/territorial programs for the\nl
 ow-income families.\nThis is a free workshop in English and Mandarin\n.\nD
 rop-in.\nIn partnership with Immigration\, Refugees and Citizenship Canada
 \, CultureLink\nSettlement & Community Services & Toronto Public Library.\
 nFriday\, July 10\, 2026:\nFederal Benefits Mainly\nFriday\, July 24\, 202
 6:\nProvincial/Territorial Benefits
LOCATION:Lillian H. Smith\, Basement
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a42705c541102b7fa8928f5
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Adults
END:VEVENT
